      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The number of sync configurations might be too large to return using a single call to [[p0]] . You can limit the number of sync configurations returned by using the [[p1]] parameter. To determine whether there are more sync configurations to list, check the value of [[p2]] in the output. If there are more sync configurations to list, you can request them by specifying the [[p3]] returned in the call to the parameter of a subsequent call.",
