    {
      "id": "s0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Examples¶",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0086",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Note",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To use the following examples, you must have the AWS CLI installed and configured. See the [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS CLI User Guide[[p2]] for more information.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Getting started guide"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Unless otherwise stated, all examples have unix-like quotation rules. These examples will need to be adapted to your terminal’s quoting rules. See [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS CLI User Guide[[p2]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Using quotation marks with strings"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]To list your resource data sync configurations[[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The following [[p0]] example retrieves information about your resource data sync configurations.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "list-resource-data-sync"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Output:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For more information, see [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS Systems Manager User Guide[[p2]].",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Creating a resource data sync for Inventory"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0093",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Output¶",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "ResourceDataSyncItems -> (list)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "A list of your current resource data sync configurations and their statuses.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "(structure)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Information about a resource data sync configuration, including its current status and last successful sync.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "SyncName -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The name of the resource data sync.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "64"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "SyncType -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The type of resource data sync. If [[p0]] is [[p1]] , then the resource data sync synchronizes data to an S3 bucket. If the [[p2]] is [[p3]] then the resource data sync synchronizes data from Organizations or from multiple Amazon Web Services Regions.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "SyncType"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "SyncToDestination"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "SyncType"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p3]]",
          "text": "SyncFromSource"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "64"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "SyncSource -> (structure)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Information about the source where the data was synchronized.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "SourceType -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The type of data source for the resource data sync. [[p0]] is either [[p1]] (if an organization is present in Organizations) or [[p2]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "SourceType"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "AwsOrganizations"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "singleAccountMultiRegions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "64"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "AwsOrganizationsSource -> (structure)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The field name in [[p0]] for the [[p1]] type.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "SyncSource"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "ResourceDataSyncAwsOrganizationsSource"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "OrganizationSourceType -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "If an Amazon Web Services organization is present, this is either [[p0]] or [[p1]] . For [[p2]] , the data is aggregated from a set of organization units. For [[p3]] , the data is aggregated from the entire Amazon Web Services organization.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "OrganizationalUnits"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "EntireOrganization"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "OrganizationalUnits"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p3]]",
          "text": "EntireOrganization"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "64"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "OrganizationalUnits -> (list)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Organizations organization units included in the sync.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1000"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "(structure)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Organizations organizational unit data source for the sync.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "OrganizationalUnitId -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Organizations unit ID data source for the sync.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "128"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "pattern: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "^ou-[0-9a-z]{4,32}-[a-z0-9]{8,32}$"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "SourceRegions -> (list)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The [[p0]] Amazon Web Services Regions included in the resource data sync.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "SyncSource"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "(string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "64"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "IncludeFutureRegions -> (boolean)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0142",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Whether to automatically synchronize and aggregate data from new Amazon Web Services Regions when those Regions come online.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0143",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "State -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The data type name for including resource data sync state. There are four sync states:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] : Your organization doesn’t exist.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "OrganizationNotExists"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] : The system can’t locate the service-linked role. This role is automatically created when a user creates a resource data sync in Explorer.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "NoPermissions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0147",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] : You specified or selected an invalid unit in the resource data sync configuration.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "InvalidOrganizationalUnit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0148",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] : You disabled Systems Manager access in the organization in Organizations.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "TrustedAccessDisabled"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0150",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0151",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "64"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "EnableAllOpsDataSources -> (boolean)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "When you create a resource data sync, if you choose one of the Organizations options, then Systems Manager automatically enables all OpsData sources in the selected Amazon Web Services Regions for all Amazon Web Services accounts in your organization (or in the selected organization units). For more information, see [[p0]] in the [[p1]]Amazon Web Services Systems Manager User Guide[[p2]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Setting up Systems Manager Explorer to display data from multiple accounts and Regions"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "S3Destination -> (structure)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0155",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Configuration information for the target S3 bucket.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0156",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "BucketName -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0157",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The name of the S3 bucket where the aggregated data is stored.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0159",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0160",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "2048"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0161",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Prefix -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0162",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "An Amazon S3 prefix for the bucket.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0163",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0164",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0165",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "256"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0166",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "SyncFormat -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0167",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "A supported sync format. The following format is currently supported: JsonSerDe",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0168",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Possible values:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0169",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "JsonSerDe"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0170",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Region -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0171",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Amazon Web Services Region with the S3 bucket targeted by the resource data sync.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0172",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0173",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0174",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "64"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0175",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "AWSKMSKeyARN -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0176",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The ARN of an encryption key for a destination in Amazon S3. Must belong to the same Region as the destination S3 bucket.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0177",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0178",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0179",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "512"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0180",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "pattern: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "arn:.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0181",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "DestinationDataSharing -> (structure)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0182",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Enables destination data sharing. By default, this field is [[p0]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "null"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0183",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "DestinationDataSharingType -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0184",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The sharing data type. Only [[p0]] is supported.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Organization"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0185",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Constraints:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0186",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "min: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0187",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "max: [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "64"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0188",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "LastSyncTime -> (timestamp)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0189",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The last time the configuration attempted to sync (UTC).",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0190",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "LastSuccessfulSyncTime -> (timestamp)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0191",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The last time the sync operations returned a status of [[p0]] (UTC).",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "SUCCESSFUL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0192",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "SyncLastModifiedTime -> (timestamp)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0193",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The date and time the resource data sync was changed.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0194",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "LastStatus -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0195",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The status reported by the last sync.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0196",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Possible values:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0197",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
